cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Kapso in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Kapso: long-running agents that optimize AI and Data systems"
abstract: >-
  Kapso is a team of long-running agents that optimize AI and Data systems, and
  learn from every experience. Give it an objective and it autonomously builds the
  best solution, deploys it, and keeps what moved the metric, with the evidence
  that earned it; it also learns from public repositories and papers.
